   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "jobs         pk job_id   state · attempt (fence) · lease_until · deadline\n                         customer_id · request_hash · snapshot_hash · result\njob_events   pk job_id, sk seq        ttl 30 d   (replay after Last-Event-ID)\nidempotency  pk customer_id#key       ttl 7 d\nsessions     pk session_id            ttl 24 h guest · 8 h admin\nquotas       pk scope#window          atomic ADD, ttl = window end\ncache        pk <ADR-0013 key string> ttl per key type · locks too\nwake_ledger  pk day, sk window_start  45 min/day cap (ADR-0014)\ncheckpoints  PK, SK (DynamoDBSaver)   ttl 7 d · > 350 KB → S3\n\nstream on jobs (INSERT) → dispatcher → SQS: the outbox without a table",
   "originalText": "jobs         pk job_id   state · attempt (fence) · lease_until · deadline\n                         customer_id · request_hash · snapshot_hash · result\njob_events   pk job_id, sk seq        ttl 30 d   (replay after Last-Event-ID)\nidempotency  pk customer_id#key       ttl 7 d\nsessions     pk session_id            ttl 24 h guest · 8 h admin\nquotas       pk scope#window          atomic ADD, ttl = window end\ncache        pk <ADR-0013 key string> ttl per key type · locks too\nwake_ledger  pk day, sk window_start  45 min/day cap (ADR-0014)\ncheckpoints  PK, SK (DynamoDBSaver)   ttl 7 d · > 350 KB → S3\n\nstream on jobs (INSERT) → dispatcher → SQS: the outbox without a table",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
