   "text": "terminal write requires attempt = mine (conditional)\n3rd receive → DLQ handler ⇒ failed\npast deadline ⇒ failed on the next read (lazy, no sweeper)\nprecedence: failed › evidence_missing › degraded › completed",
   "originalText": "terminal write requires attempt = mine (conditional)\n3rd receive → DLQ handler ⇒ failed\npast deadline ⇒ failed on the next read (lazy, no sweeper)\nprecedence: failed › evidence_missing › degraded › completed",
