  {
   "id": "c_code_t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 76,
   "y": 442,
   "width": 653.125,
   "height": 165.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#22c55e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1030,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1030,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "accept   TransactWriteItems [\n           Put idempotency  IF attribute_not_exists(pk)   # else same hash → same job, else 409\n           Put jobs(queued, attempt 0) · Put job_events seq 1 ]\nclaim    UpdateItem jobs SET attempt = attempt + 1, state = running\n           IF state = queued OR (state = running AND lease_until < :now)\ncommit   Transact [ConditionCheck jobs: state = running AND attempt = :mine,\n                   Put job_events IF attribute_not_exists(seq)]\nexpire   SET state = failed, attempt = attempt + 1 IF lease_until < :now\nlock     Put lock:memo:… IF attribute_not_exists(pk) OR expires_at < :now\nquota    ADD n 1 IF attribute_not_exists(n) OR n < :limit\n\ncache keys unchanged (ev: · qe: · rr: · memo:) · read error ⇒ run cold",
   "originalText": "accept   TransactWriteItems [\n           Put idempotency  IF attribute_not_exists(pk)   # else same hash → same job, else 409\n           Put jobs(queued, attempt 0) · Put job_events seq 1 ]\nclaim    UpdateItem jobs SET attempt = attempt + 1, state = running\n           IF state = queued OR (state = running AND lease_until < :now)\ncommit   Transact [ConditionCheck jobs: state = running AND attempt = :mine,\n                   Put job_events IF attribute_not_exists(seq)]\nexpire   SET state = failed, attempt = attempt + 1 IF lease_until < :now\nlock     Put lock:memo:… IF attribute_not_exists(pk) OR expires_at < :now\nquota    ADD n 1 IF attribute_not_exists(n) OR n < :limit\n\ncache keys unchanged (ev: · qe: · rr: · memo:) · read error ⇒ run cold",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
